# ===================================================================
# Notes API Playground (.http / REST Client)
# ===================================================================
# Berkas ini digunakan untuk pengujian interaktif REST API secara langsung
# melalui VS Code (REST Client extension), JetBrains Rider, atau Visual Studio.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@username = admin
@password = admin123

# ===================================================================
# 1. Health Checks & Diagnostics
# ===================================================================

### 1.1 Health Check (Database & API Status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health


# ===================================================================
# 2. Authentication API (JWT Bearer & Refresh Tokens)
# ===================================================================

### 2.1 Register User Baru
# @name registerUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "developer",
  "email": "developer@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### 2.2 Login User & Dapatkan Access Token + Refresh Token
# @name loginUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "developer",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### Variabel Token dari Response Login
@jwtToken = {{loginUser.response.body.data.accessToken}}
@refreshTokenStr = {{loginUser.response.body.data.refreshToken}}

### 2.3 Refresh Access Token
# @name refreshAuthToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshTokenStr}}"
}


# ===================================================================
# 3. Notes Management API (Dengan Auth JWT Bearer)
# ===================================================================

### 3.1 Create Note (POST)
# @name createNote
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Belajar ASP.NET Core & Clean Architecture",
  "content": "Memahami JWT Auth, Serilog, OpenTelemetry, EF Core Migrations, dan Optimistic Concurrency."
}

### Variabel Note ID dari Response Create
@noteId = {{createNote.response.body.data.id}}

### 3.2 Get Paged Notes Dengan Filter & Sorting
# Mengambil daftar catatan dengan fitur pencarian kata kunci dan pengurutan dinamis
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notes?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&searchKeyword=Clean&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### 3.3 Get Note By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notes/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### 3.4 Update Note (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notes/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Belajar ASP.NET Core & Clean Architecture (Diperbarui)",
  "content": "Sudah berhasil mengimplementasikan 15 item production improvement!"
}

### 3.5 Get Analytics (Raw SQL Query & Aggregations)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notes/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### 3.6 Delete Note (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notes/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}


# ===================================================================
# 4. Pengujian Compatibility Basic Auth (Bila Digunakan)
# ===================================================================

### 4.1 Get Paged Notes (Basic Auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notes?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}


# ===================================================================
# 5. Pengujian Error Handling & Validasi (RFC 7807 Standard)
# ===================================================================

### 5.1 Test Tanpa Autentikasi (Expect 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notes

### 5.2 Test Validasi Input Kosong (Expect 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "content": "Judul dikosongkan untuk menguji handler validasi."
}

### 5.3 Test Resource Tidak Ditemukan (Expect 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
